    "detailed_description": "Title: School Curse<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGenre: Horror<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlatform: PC<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRelease date: December 8, 2023<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nstory<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLate at night, one girl remained at school. She gathered the magic books hidden in the school and set out to escape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe school was shrouded in darkness and silence. The girl moves forward cautiously, sensing the monster's presence.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere were blood stains in the hallway. Traces of fear were left in the classroom.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe girl goes deeper into the school to find the magic book.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience fear from a third-person perspective<br />\r\nCollect magic books hidden throughout the school<br />\r\nAiming to escape while being chased by monsters<br />\r\nvisual<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game's graphics are created using a combination of 3DCG and hand-drawn illustrations to express a dark and gloomy atmosphere.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe soundtrack is intentionally silent to heighten the fear.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTarget group<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPeople who like horror games, people who like third-person perspective games<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFear you can experience<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe darkness and silence of the school, the presence of monsters, traces of blood, traces of fear.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTogether, these elements allow players to experience maximum fear.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame development<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game's simple content is to collect magic books hidden throughout the school and aim to escape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHowever, a monster is lurking in the school, and the player must collect magic books while being chased by the monster.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMagic books are hidden throughout the school, and you will need to explore to find them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMonsters move quickly and have high attack power, so players must act carefully.",
    "about_the_game": "Title: School Curse<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGenre: Horror<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlatform: PC<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRelease date: December 8, 2023<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nstory<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLate at night, one girl remained at school. She gathered the magic books hidden in the school and set out to escape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe school was shrouded in darkness and silence. The girl moves forward cautiously, sensing the monster's presence.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere were blood stains in the hallway. Traces of fear were left in the classroom.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe girl goes deeper into the school to find the magic book.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience fear from a third-person perspective<br />\r\nCollect magic books hidden throughout the school<br />\r\nAiming to escape while being chased by monsters<br />\r\nvisual<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game's graphics are created using a combination of 3DCG and hand-drawn illustrations to express a dark and gloomy atmosphere.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe soundtrack is intentionally silent to heighten the fear.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTarget group<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPeople who like horror games, people who like third-person perspective games<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFear you can experience<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe darkness and silence of the school, the presence of monsters, traces of blood, traces of fear.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTogether, these elements allow players to experience maximum fear.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame development<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game's simple content is to collect magic books hidden throughout the school and aim to escape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHowever, a monster is lurking in the school, and the player must collect magic books while being chased by the monster.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMagic books are hidden throughout the school, and you will need to explore to find them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMonsters move quickly and have high attack power, so players must act carefully.",
